      "body": "插件商店介紹:\nhttps://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/deepsrt-experience-the-fa/mdaaadlpcanoofcoeanghbmpbdbhladd\nDeepSRT - Enhance your YouTube experience with multi-language smart summaries, and real-time translations in a sleek sidebar.\n\n作者: Pahud\nhttps://x.com/pahudnet\n\n其它人推薦 DeepSRT \nhttps://x.com/minorun365/status/1890027739442532760\n日本AWS Hero 御田 稔氏 在X上面跟日本社群推薦了DeepSRT\n御田 稔先生是 KDDI Agile 開發中心的技術推廣大使。\n他除了從事軟體開發工作外，還積極對外分享工作上習得的知識，將科技的樂趣傳遞給更多人。\n\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e61dfc0c-2681-40f1-af84-975dde9705c4)\n\n謝謝\n",
